Changes include selecting source tables and fields; normalizing case,
spelling, and whitespace; integrating and deduplicating terminology with
other sources; assigning release-local identifiers; mapping and filtering
terms using RxNorm; and separating accepted and quarantined records. No
endorsement by HemOnc.org LLC is implied. See
https://hemonc.org/wiki/HemOncKB and
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/.

