The DrugBank input is limited to DrugBank Vocabulary Open Data identifiers,
names, and synonyms released under CC0 1.0. No separately licensed DrugBank
full-database content is used. The CC0 status of the underlying DrugBank
Vocabulary records is unchanged. Raw third-party source packages are
excluded.

